00:08:01,551 --> 00:08:04,540
and making requests of your web server.

135
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:06,587
So every unit of work that comes in so

136
00:08:06,587 --> 00:08:10,836
every page request in the thread per
connection model would get a thread.

137
00:08:10,836 --> 00:08:14,488
And then if there's blocking I/O that
has to happen in order to complete that

138
00:08:14,488 --> 00:08:18,140
