147
00:08:48,170 --> 00:08:51,765
This model tends to break down as
a number of requests becomes very large.

148
00:08:51,765 --> 00:08:55,088
And that has to do with the fact
that every every one of the unit of

149
00:08:55,088 --> 00:08:56,671
